  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4a37d28b8c7f2df48b1507ff896a86fa, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialBackstory
  backstoryCanvas: {fileID: 1962870760}
  backstoryBgImage: {fileID: 1605053281}
  backstoryText: {fileID: 197407177}
  gameplayTutorialUI: {fileID: 1572686746}
  textSpeed: 0.05
  gameplayDelay: 1.5
  backstorySequence:
  - storyIllustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b63bc8d0706e3640a8bf8aa3d116a51, type: 3}
    dialogueText: One day, a young man had an incredibly exhausting day at work.
      Since morning, his desk had been piled high with tasks that needed immediate
      attention. The longer he worked, the more new tasks kept piling up without
      end. The constantly mounting pressure left him feeling burned out and completely
      fed up with his routine.
  - storyIllustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c2131386c5fe4204d83ead3eb1e8eda3, type: 3}
    dialogueText: After work finally ended, he took the train home. Throughout the
      journey, he just stared out the window, reflecting on his life. His days were
      so consumed by work and pressure that he realized it had been a long time since
      he last took a moment to truly enjoy life or feel genuine happiness.
  - storyIllustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 18e8179ebda621f48859122d383699bf, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Upon arriving at home, he sat for a moment on the living room sofa.
      On his left, there was a cardboard doll, a toy that in the past always accompanied
      him to play during his childhood. Without thinking long, he took the doll and
      started playing with it.
  - storyIllustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b45880d06e85ac04189796c1a4bdda3b, type: 3}
    dialogueText: Childhood memories full of laughter and without burdens crossed
      his mind again, reminding him of a time when happiness felt so simple. Not
      long after, fatigue defeated his consciousness. With the cardboard doll still
      in his embrace, he fell asleep on the sofa
